- **redistribute or share it**, publicly or privately, including publishing it
  to a public repository, a file share, a community, a course, or a group chat,
- **offer it as a service** to anyone else, whether paid or free, hosted or
  installed for them,
- **use it to deliver work product to your own clients as a licensed or
  resold tool**, or bundle it into anything you sell. Using it to write your own
  outreach is fine. Handing your client a copy is not,
- **distribute it on Mani Kanasani's behalf**, or state or imply that you are
  authorised to give it to anyone, or that he endorses, supports, supplies or
