This holds wherever you are. If you are outside British Columbia, you may have
rights under your local law that cannot be waived by agreement, including
consumer protection rights; nothing here takes those away, and where local law
must override this section it does, with the rest of this licence left standing.

**Before filing anything, talk to me.** Email mani@growthcreators.ai with what
happened and give it thirty days. Most of what could go wrong here is a
misunderstanding about scope, and a conversation settles it faster and cheaper
than either of us going near a court.

Either of us may still bring a claim in a small claims court or tribunal, and
either of us may seek an injunction in any court that will hear it to stop
unauthorised copying or redistribution, without waiting out the thirty days.

